sections.body:
Bird dog will look for properties that match the Investor's criteria:

{{criteria}}

and submit leads in writing that include: {{lead_info}}

Bird dog's role is limited to finding and passing along information.

Bird dog will not:
- negotiate price or terms, make offers, or sign anything for Investor;
- claim to be a real estate agent, broker or Investor's representative, or say they will be paid if a sale happens;
- enter property without permission, harass owners, or use deceptive tactics; or
- contact people in violation of telemarketing, texting, do-not-call or privacy laws.

Bird dog: [[initial:birddog]]
